    <briefdescription>
<para>Adapter satisfying loc::Communicator with VT objgroup messaging. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The containing <ref refid="structvt_1_1location_1_1_entity_location_coord" kindref="compound">EntityLocationCoord</ref> is already a collectively-created objgroup, so its proxy is also the collective instance handle expected by loc. Control-plane RPCs are dispatched to the embedded loc coordinator. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
